## Upstream acknowledgment

Engram is an English, purist *process* fork of [Nuwa (女娲.skill)](https://github.com/alchaincyf/nuwa-skill)
by Huashu (花叔), also MIT-licensed. The empirical pipeline shape (six
research agents, triple-verified models, expression DNA, dual-agent
fidelity scorecard, companion scripts) follows Nuwa. Engram does not
claim Nuwa endorsement. Do not mutate upstream Nuwa when using this fork.

Intentional Engram cuts vs Nuwa include: no pirate book download (Z-Library /
LibGen); write path under `engrams/<slug>/`; Engram attribution (not the
Nuwa creator block); non-git version-check skip when the install is not a clone.
